  "_villagersAbout": "villagers: the parts of the people of the generated hamlets (src/core/gen/people.js). Each villager takes one choice of each part from the seed of the world, so that no two hamlets look the same: an age (grown, child, or old; a child is smaller, an old person has grey hair and sometimes a beard), a body (the clothes of a man or a woman), a skin, clothes (the colors of the top, the bottom, and the sash), a hair for each body (grey: the shape of the grey hair of an old person of the body), a hat (or none), an item in the hand (or none), and a face. The villagers of the hamlets are not people of the story: they have no names and no talks, and they are not historical people.",
